ns-04-150x150.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-image-1778\" alt=\"solar panel bird proofing melbourne\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cd1d42d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"cd1d42d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Starlings<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Known for their tendency to nest in hard-to-reach places, including on roofs and under solar panels, starlings can be a challenge to remove.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3469fc5 e-con-full e-transform e-transform e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3469fc5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8979b6e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"8979b6e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Birds-icons-05-150x150.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-image-1779\" alt=\"solar panel bird proofing melbourne\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d026b4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"d026b4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Indian Mynas<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">These aggressive birds often build large, damaging nests in hard-to-reach spots, such as roof spaces, gutters, and air conditioning units.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e63bc1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6e63bc1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1822e51 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1822e51\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Sustainable Bird Proofing for Your Property<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d1f7418 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d1f7418\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ccf6e3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1ccf6e3\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6889d0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d6889d0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Birds are an integral part of nature, but when they begin nesting on your property, they can cause significant issues. At\u00a0<span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><a style=\"color: #ffffff;\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/\"><strong>7 States Pest Control<\/strong><\/a>,<\/span> we offer bird proofing solutions that protect your solar panels, roofs, gutters, and other property areas from damage, all while remaining eco-friendly and humane. Our methods are designed to keep birds away without harming them, ensuring long-lasting protection for your home.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-45473b1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"45473b1\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aab713d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"aab713d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Here\u2019s how our methods ensure everything is safe and secure:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd8c2a0 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"fd8c2a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Environmentally Safe Materials: We use bird-proofing products made from sustainable and eco-conscious materials, ensuring that no harm comes to the environment while safeguarding your property.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Safe Deterrents for Birds: Our bird-proofing techniques focus on gently deterring birds from nesting under your solar panels or other hard-to-reach places without causing harm. These safe deterrents help to keep the birds at bay while respecting their natural habits.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Professional, Secure Installation: Our experienced team takes care of every detail during installation to ensure that the bird-proofing systems are secure and effectively keep birds from entering your property. We focus on providing long-term protection that doesn\u2019t compromise the structure of your home.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Ongoing Monitoring and Maintenance: We offer continued monitoring to ensure that our bird-proofing methods remain effective year-round, addressing any changes in bird behaviour or potential weaknesses in the protection system.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d3bcb94 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d3bcb94\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1718067 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1718067\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-78b0737 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"78b0737\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The Advantages of Bird Proofing for Solar Panels in Melbourne<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-751b963 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"751b963\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Investing in bird proofing for your solar panels not only protects your system but also ensures optimal performance and longevity. While the costs of bird-proofing can vary depending on your specific needs, the benefits far outweigh the expense. Here\u2019s why bird proofing is a must for solar panel owners in Melbourne:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62fdcad e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"62fdcad\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-47a78bd e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"47a78bd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f71c8a elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"3f71c8a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Reduced-Maintenance-Costs-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7925\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Reduced-Maintenance-Costs-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Reduced-Maintenance-Costs-2048x2048-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Reduced-Maintenance-Costs-2048x2048-1-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Reduced-Maintenance-Costs-2048x2048-1-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Reduced-Maintenance-Costs-2048x2048-1-1536x1536.png 1536w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Reduced-Maintenance-Costs-2048x2048-1.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-239054b elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"239054b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCut Down on Repair and Maintenance Costs\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBird droppings and nests can damage electrical components, wires, and other parts of your solar system. These issues often lead to costly repairs. Bird-proofing your panels helps you avoid frequent maintenance and repairs, saving you money in the long run by reducing the chances of damage caused by birds.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-161dace e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"161dace\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-df19d9e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"df19d9e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Maximised-Energy-Efficiency-02-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7921\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Maximised-Energy-Efficiency-02-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Maximised-Energy-Efficiency-02-2048x2048-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Maximised-Energy-Efficiency-02-2048x2048-1-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Maximised-Energy-Efficiency-02-2048x2048-1-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Maximised-Energy-Efficiency-02-2048x2048-1-1536x1536.png 1536w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Maximised-Energy-Efficiency-02-2048x2048-1.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17d5b9b elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"17d5b9b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBoost Energy Efficiency\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWhen birds nest under your solar panels, they obstruct sunlight, which reduces the amount of energy your system can produce. By investing in bird proofing, you ensure your panels remain clean and unobstructed, allowing them to generate more power, ultimately boosting the overall energy efficiency of your solar system.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8936d07 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8936d07\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4181880 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"4181880\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Extended-Solar-Panel-Lifespan-01-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7918\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Extended-Solar-Panel-Lifespan-01-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Extended-Solar-Panel-Lifespan-01-2048x2048-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Extended-Solar-Panel-Lifespan-01-2048x2048-1-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Extended-Solar-Panel-Lifespan-01-2048x2048-1-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Extended-Solar-Panel-Lifespan-01-2048x2048-1-1536x1536.png 1536w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Extended-Solar-Panel-Lifespan-01-2048x2048-1.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5d86832 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"5d86832\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEnhance the Longevity of Your Solar Panels\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBirds, especially pigeons and seagulls, can cause significant damage by nesting under your solar panels. Droppings, nests, and debris can lead to corrosion, block sunlight, and eventually reduce the lifespan of your panels. Bird-proofing your panels prevents these issues, helping them last longer and continue to work efficiently.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e86bf87 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e86bf87\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e635623 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e635623\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9713de7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"9713de7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Continuous-Solar-Output-07-07-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7937\" alt=\"Continuous-Solar-Output\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Continuous-Solar-Output-07-07-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Continuous-Solar-Output-07-07-2048x2048-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Continuous-Solar-Output-07-07-2048x2048-1-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Continuous-Solar-Output-07-07-2048x2048-1-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Continuous-Solar-Output-07-07-2048x2048-1-1536x1536.png 1536w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Continuous-Solar-Output-07-07-2048x2048-1.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3774c48 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"3774c48\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tConsistent Solar Energy Generation\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBirds can disrupt the operation of your solar panels, leading to inconsistent energy output. By installing effective bird-proofing measures, you ensure that your solar system continues to operate smoothly and consistently, reducing downtime and ensuring you get the most from your solar investment.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2f733ae e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2f733ae\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8e36d1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c8e36d1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Safe-and-Eco-Friendly-06-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-7934\" alt=\"Safe-and-Eco-Friendly\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Safe-and-Eco-Friendly-06-2048x2048-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Safe-and-Eco-Friendly-06-2048x2048-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Safe-and-Eco-Friendly-06-2048x2048-1-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Safe-and-Eco-Friendly-06-2048x2048-1-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Safe-and-Eco-Friendly-06-2048x2048-1-1536x1536.png 1536w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/Safe-and-Eco-Friendly-06-2048x2048-1.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-520b6d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"520b6d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elemen