element elementor-element-4c08d72 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"4c08d72\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-check-double\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Don\u2019t Wait Until It\u2019s Too Late<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-879c38b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"879c38b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"\" data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"668\">If you haven\u2019t noticed bird activity around your solar panels yet, don\u2019t wait for the damage to start.\u00a0<a rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"362\">Contact us today<\/a>\u00a0for a quick, same-day inspection and ensure your panels are protected from potential nesting and damage. We specialize in\u00a0<strong data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"530\">Bird Blocking<\/strong>\u00a0to prevent costly damage to your solar system, and our team is ready to help you maintain the safety and efficiency of your solar panels.<\/p><p class=\"\" data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"918\"><strong data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"699\">Birds around solar panels<\/strong>\u00a0can create significant issues, from nesting to debris buildup, which can lead to costly repairs. With our\u00a0<strong data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"823\">Bird Blocking<\/strong>\u00a0services, we\u2019ll help protect your solar investment and keep your panels functioning optimally.<\/p><p class=\"\" data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1350\">We also offer a range of other pest control services such as\u00a0<strong data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1238\"><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/rodent-control-melbourne\/\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1236\">Rodent Extermination<\/a><\/strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<a rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1286\">Bed Bug Removal<\/a>\u00a0to ensure your home remains safe from pests all year round.<\/p><p class=\"\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1520\">For more pest prevention tips and expert advice, check out our\u00a0<a rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1450\">latest\u00a0<\/a><strong data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1452\"><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/blog\/\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1450\">blog\u00a0<\/a><\/strong><a rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1450\">post<\/a>\u00a0to learn how to protect your home from unwanted pests and damage.<\/p><p class=\"\" data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1659\">Don\u2019t wait until it\u2019s too late! Get in touch with\u00a0<strong>7 State<a rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1616\">\u00a0Pest Control<\/a><\/strong>\u00a0today and ensure your home is protected.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f9064c7 e-flex e-con-boxe